sequenceDiagram
    participant L as lifecycle
    participant PR as processes
    participant PC as persons-cohorts
    participant W as workflows
    participant S as services
    participant E as edge
    participant H as history
    participant J as judge
    L->>L: loadCard(path, adapters):<br/>refused if a link drops the carrier
    L->>PR: stop, head first
    L->>W: reset(): jobs, SES bucket
    L->>PC: reset(): groups to the end
    L->>PR: start tail first, readiness
    L->>W: prepare(run)
    W-->>L: seed, hook path {person.id}
    L->>PC: prepare(run)
    PC-->>L: validity: live topic, allowlist
    L->>PR: observe topology vs manifest
    Note over L,W: a failed check or a process<br/>declared but not observed:<br/>invalid, stop before drive (Q2)
    L->>H: manifest beside topology
    loop each unit, open loop
        L->>PC: offer(unit)
        PC->>S: $set to capture,<br/>distinct_id = unit
        PC->>H: offer: carrier person_id
    end
    S->>E: POST /hook/{person.id}
    E->>H: outcome: person_id,<br/>status (Q3)
    loop until quiet or convergeWithin
        L->>PC: pending()
        L->>W: pending()
    end
    Note over L,W: quiet: all pending is 0 and every<br/>expected delivery is recorded.<br/>Unknown pending is not 0 (Q4)
    L->>J: check(history, counts)
    J-->>L: invariants, ledger (Q5), status (Q6)
    L->>L: payloadOf v2, publish, down
